  text: 'Tutorial Steps: 1) Teleport onto Pad T, 2) Grab the blue Test Cube (G), 3) Drop it into the center Socket, 4) Press the Green Button (T/N), 5) Ray-point at the Tutorial Screen, and 6) Press Y (or F on Desktop) to summon and dismiss your Floating Lab Tablet!'
